<title>BELGIUM: EU nears deal on EMU pact-Belgian fin min.</title>
<headline>EU nears deal on EMU pact-Belgian fin min.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Finance Minister Philippe Maystadt said on Sunday that EU finance ministers were near a deal on the EMU stability pact but that more work would have to be done on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Almost,&quot; Maystadt said when asked about a deal following a dinner with his colleagues.</p>
</text>
